## Clinical Guidelines

- **LDL Cholesterol**: 
  - Optimal: <100 mg/dL
  - Near optimal: 100-129 mg/dL
  - Borderline high: 130-159 mg/dL
  - High: 160-189 mg/dL
  - Very high: ≥190 mg/dL

- **HbA1c**:
  - Normal: <5.7%
  - Prediabetes: 5.7-6.4%
  - Diabetes: ≥6.5%

- **TSH**:
  - Normal: 0.4-4.0 mIU/L
  - Subclinical hypothyroidism: >4.0 mIU/L
  - Subclinical hyperthyroidism: <0.4 mIU/L

- **Ferritin**:
  - Low iron stores: <30 ng/mL (men), <15 ng/mL (women)
  - Iron deficiency: <12 ng/mL

